<title>UK: Credit Local sets 400 mln Ecu 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 400 mln Ecu 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN ECU   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    24.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.415   PAY DATE    24.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.79     SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/PAR   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA    DENOMS (K) 10-100-1,000 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 6.0 PCT 2001 BTAN AND</p>
<p>		6.75 PCT 2002 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISDA/IPMA ECU STANDARD CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
